# kw-export-full: Does an export line with a name that does not exist stop the load (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: error
# pc: ODE0032
# ruling: XPPAUT prints Cant export ... - non existent! and writes no output, so the line was read as an export statement. run.sh counts non existent as an XPPAUT error message.
x'=0
x(0)=3
par a=5
aux v=a
export {zz} {yy}
@ total=0,dt=1
